        <updateDate>2026-09-11T10:41:46Z</updateDate>
        <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Affordable Innovation for the Grid Act</strong></p><p>This bill directs the Department of Energy to assess and report on the use of artificial intelligence and high-performance computing technologies to enhance the capacity, reliable operation, and operational efficiency of the bulk-power system.</p>]]></text>
      </summary>
